stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Connecting: start / auto
    Connecting --> Connected: handshake OK
    Connecting --> Error: failure
    Connected --> Disconnecting: stop
    Connected --> Reconnecting: health fail
    Reconnecting --> Connecting
    Disconnecting --> Disconnected
    Disconnected --> Idle
    Error --> Reconnecting: retry policy

    Connected: emit vpn.connected trigger
    Connected: emit tunnel TransportBinding
    Connected --> IpReady: IPv4 assigned
    IpReady: emit vpn.ip_ready
    IpReady --> Connected: address removed

    Disconnected: emit vpn.disconnected trigger
    Error: emit vpn.disconnected trigger
